1
00:00:02,660 --> 00:00:03,780
Dos carteles.

2
00:00:03,820 --> 00:00:05,120
El mismo producto.

3
00:00:05,160 --> 00:00:06,200
¿Cuál vende más?

4
00:00:06,240 --> 00:00:07,080
A la izquierda,

5
00:00:07,120 --> 00:00:08,020
un precio suelto:

6
00:00:08,060 --> 00:00:09,540
siete euros con veinte.

7
00:00:09,580 --> 00:00:11,620
A la derecha,
el mismo precio,

8
00:00:11,660 --> 00:00:12,800
pero con el de antes:

9
00:00:12,840 --> 00:00:14,050
doce euros.

10
00:00:14,520 --> 00:00:16,310
Tu cerebro no calcula.

11
00:00:16,400 --> 00:00:17,310
Compara.

12
00:00:20,520 --> 00:00:21,690
Sin una referencia,

13
00:00:21,730 --> 00:00:23,090
